[PATCH 17/17] Documentation/mm: multi-gen LRU: update for frequency guided promotion
[PATCH 16/17] mm/mglru: make folio_test_workingset() work based on folio LRU refs
[PATCH 15/17] mm/mglru: make folio_inc_lru_refs lruvec lockless
[PATCH 14/17] mm/mglru: reparent folios from all generations
[PATCH 13/17] mm/mglru: folio LRU refs based active/inactive number accounting
[PATCH 12/17] mm/huge_memory: mark folio as accessed more accurately on split
[PATCH 11/17] mm/madvise: adapt for LRU refs based operations for MGLRU
[PATCH 10/17] mm/khugepaged: convert to LRU refs based operations for MGLRU
[PATCH 09/17] mm/damon: convert to LRU refs based operations for MGLRU
[PATCH 08/17] mm/mglru, smaps: convert to LRU refs based operations for MGLRU
[PATCH 07/17] mm/mglru, gup: mark folios referenced via a fast helper
[PATCH 06/17] mm/mglru: move add/del LRU size accounting out of lru_gen_update_size()
[PATCH 05/17] mm/mglru: make folio lru referenced times count a generic API
[PATCH 04/17] mm/mglru: frequency guided workingset promotion (MGLRU-FG)
[PATCH 03/17] mm/memcg: add folio-based lruvec live helper
[PATCH 02/17] mm/mglru: make generation page counters atomic
[PATCH 01/17] mm/memcontrol: allow update of LRU statistic without holding LRU lock

